        <item>
            <title>3.0.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 01:56:45 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>20260724</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.0.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's New in v3.0.0</h2>
                <h3>New</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Firefly Cloud
                        <ul>
                            <li>Cloud Upload & Sharing - Upload any game or clip to Firefly Cloud and instantly get a link to share it with your friends, duos, or coaches!</li>
                            <li>Cloud as your primary storage - On selected paid plans you can use Firefly Cloud as your only storage saving valuable SSD space and allowing you to interact with your cloud recordings straight from the Cloud as if they were locally on your disk.</li>
                            <li>Subscription plans to fit everyone - Firefly Cloud comes with a free option so everyone gets something just by signing in! We also offer paid subscriptions for more generous upload limits and features like hosting montages and the primary storage feature.</li>
                            <li>Sign in with Apple - No new account or password to create. Just use the Apple ID you already have — Apple handles the login, not us, so we do not have access to or store any credentials.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                    <li>League Classic Support
                        <ul>
                            <li>Initial support for League Classic implemented, games will record and can be uploaded to Firefly Cloud but not all features may be working yet.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <h3>Bugfixes</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Fixed several UI glitches in list views and light mode.</li>
                </ul>
                <p>For the full detailed changelog please visit <a href="https://fireflymac.gg/changelog.html">https://fireflymac.gg/changelog.html</a>.</p>
            ]]></description>
